            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A reading apparatus that reads a radiograph from an imaging plate includes: a first light source that irradiates the imaging plate with excitation light; a first detector that detects photostimulated light from the imaging plate emitted by the excitation light; a second light source that irradiates an object with light; and a second detector that detects reflected light of the light from the object.</p>
